2026-10-13T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-2316) 'Bao holds a bounded set
 # tags: rfd:details-title
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:12Z (RFD66606-2316) '- Bao stores keys, configuration, policies and ReBAC tuples, and nothing that
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-2316) '  grows with users, sessions or requests (operator, 2026-10-13).
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-2316) '- An engine that issues a credential per request keeps no lease and no record
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:15Z (RFD66606-2316) '  of it. The credential carries its own expiry and is never revoked.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:16Z (RFD66606-2316) '- Application data lives outside Bao, in the service that owns it.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:17Z (RFD66606-2316) '- Every engine ships a growth gate: issuing many credentials leaves the
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:18Z (RFD66606-2316) '  engine's storage unchanged, and a control that stores each one fails it.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

