2026-10-13T00:00:25Z (RFD66606-2316) 'Why the limit is part of the design
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:26Z (RFD66606-2316) 'FoundationDB refuses a value over 100,000 bytes and a transaction over
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:27Z (RFD66606-2316) '10,000,000 bytes, so the limit is part of the design and not a setting.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:28Z (RFD66606-2316) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:29Z (RFD66606-2316) 'Sources
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:30Z (RFD66606-2316) 'Written on 2026-10-13 from the operator's note that Bao has a hard data
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:31Z (RFD66606-2316) 'limit by design. The FDB backend was read in our OpenBao fork: `Put`
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:32Z (RFD66606-2316) 'calls one `Set` with the whole encrypted entry and splits nothing. The
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:33Z (RFD66606-2316) 'value and transaction limits are FoundationDB's published known limits.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:34Z (RFD66606-2316) 'Neither limit has been measured on our cluster yet; the first engine's
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:35Z (RFD66606-2316) 'end-to-end test writes an entry just under and just over 100,000 bytes and
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:36Z (RFD66606-2316) 'records which one FDB refuses.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:37Z (RFD66606-2316) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:38Z (RFD66606-2316) 'What may be stored
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:39Z (RFD66606-2316) 'An entry belongs in Bao when the count of such entries is set by the
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:40Z (RFD66606-2316) 'operator, not by traffic:
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:41Z (RFD66606-2316) '- signing keys, CA keys and certificates of issuers;
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:42Z (RFD66606-2316) '- engine and mount configuration;
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:43Z (RFD66606-2316) '- policies, cert roles and ReBAC tuples;
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:44Z (RFD66606-2316) '- one-off secrets an operator puts there, such as an API token.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:45Z (RFD66606-2316) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

