 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:47Z (RFD66606-2316) '- a lease or record per issued credential;
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:48Z (RFD66606-2316) '- sessions, messages, counters, logs or audit trails of a service;
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:49Z (RFD66606-2316) '- files and blobs of any size.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:50Z (RFD66606-2316) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:51Z (RFD66606-2316) 'An engine that needs to hold a resource for a while, such as a slot in a
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:52Z (RFD66606-2316) 'shared cap, may still use a lease, because the number of leases is capped
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:53Z (RFD66606-2316) 'by the resource and not by traffic. Its growth gate then checks that the
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:54Z (RFD66606-2316) 'lease count stays at or under the cap.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:55Z (RFD66606-2316) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:56Z (RFD66606-2316) 'The growth gate
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:57Z (RFD66606-2316) 'Each engine's unit tests run against `logical.InmemStorage` and count its
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:58Z (RFD66606-2316) 'keys with a recursive `List` before and after issuing 1,000 credentials.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:00:59Z (RFD66606-2316) 'The gate passes when the count and the summed value size are unchanged.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:01:00Z (RFD66606-2316) 'The control flips the engine to store each credential and must fail the
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:01:01Z (RFD66606-2316) 'same gate. The end-to-end test does the same against a dev server and also
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:01:02Z (RFD66606-2316) 'checks that the response carries no lease id.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-13T00:01:03Z (RFD66606-2316) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2316  1 LINE
 Text:Written

